{"id":"n81809-1-7","stage":4,"title":"절이다 · 使腌渍","scene":"餐饮与生活","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n81809-1-7-1","ko":"소금에 절여 놓은 배추 좀 가져오너라.","zh":"把用盐腌好的白菜拿过来吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"소금에","meaning":"盐，咸盐","explanation":"소금：盐，咸盐；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"소금","audio":"/audio/3d09660e62955de5ce0d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61167","senseId":"1","lemma":"소금","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"소금에","audio":"/audio/a0c8fbf89daf258e6d4c.mp3"}},{"text":"절여","meaning":"使腌渍","explanation":"절이다：使腌渍；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"절이다","audio":"/audio/998cbe7ab0fe13721845.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"81809","senseId":"1","lemma":"절이다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"절여","audio":"/audio/6e8d9823831a97bf7745.mp3"}},{"text":"놓은","meaning":"表示前面所指的行为结束后其结果仍持续。","explanation":"놓다：表示前面所指的行为结束后其结果仍持续。；은：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"놓다","audio":"/audio/bac7d20277d64d673e40.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72578","senseId":"1","lemma":"놓다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"놓은","audio":"/audio/269721ea83189783919a.mp3"}},{"text":"배추","meaning":"白菜","explanation":"배추：白菜","readings":[{"term":"배추","audio":"/audio/a18cd4c77384f16eea2a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58433","senseId":"1","lemma":"배추","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"배추","audio":"/audio/a18cd4c77384f16eea2a.mp3"}},{"text":"좀","meaning":"一下","explanation":"좀：一下","readings":[{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75798","senseId":"3","lemma":"좀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}},{"text":"가져오너라.","meaning":"带来，拿来，取来","explanation":"가져오다：带来，拿来，取来；너라：向亲近的人或晚辈发出指示、劝告或请求。","readings":[{"term":"가져오다","audio":"/audio/13f6f1041daf74b52d00.mp3"}],"sources":[{"e